            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.5.3</h2>
<ul>
<li>Contacts: the people from the Contacts app are now listed under “All contacts”, as in Apple's app (they include iCloud and your other accounts, not only what is stored on the Mac). The contacts kept in Lina appear under “Lina contacts” when both are shown, and the setting is now “Show names from the Contacts app”.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
