            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.5.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Sidebar: your lines with their state, one click to choose the line the next call leaves from, and your favourite contacts one click away from a call.</li>
<li>Compact window: the “Enter a number” prompt is no longer cut off on the right.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
